      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]There you are, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Just\\nthe\\r\\nperson\\r\\nI\\r\\nwas\\r\\nlooking\\r\\nfor![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
